  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to improve the living conditions of the population and to support the economic growth of the country by providing year-round, reliable and direct land transport service between the western part of Tajikistan, including the Capital Dushanbe, and the eastern Region of Gorno-Badakhshan</narrative>
